# Name: Storage Vendor CSI Drivers
# Select this set, then remove the vendors you don't use.
# For Red Hat OpenShift Data Foundation (ODF), use the 'odf' operator set instead.
# Please let the ABA project maintainers know if there are any missing operators or dependencies!

dell-csm-operator-certified        # Dell Container Storage Modules
trident-operator                   # NetApp Trident CSI driver
ibm-block-csi-operator             # IBM Block Storage
hpe-csi-operator                   # HPE CSI
hspc-operator                      # Hitachi Storage Plug-in for Containers (HPE)
portworx-certified                 # Portworx Enterprise
portworx-multi-cluster-certified   # Portworx Multi-Cluster replication

cincinnati-operator                # Included for easier cluster upgrades
